{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimal, editorial-style Shopify section titled "Why We Chose Bamboo", replicating the supplied reference image as closely as possible.
    
    IMPORTANT: Do not redesign, reinterpret, simplify, or introduce a different layout. Follow the reference image's structure, proportions, alignment, spacing, and visual hierarchy.
    
    1. SECTION LAYOUT
    
    Full-width section.
    
    Desktop background colour: muted olive green (#626B4C approximately).
    
    Two-column layout.
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Generous vertical padding: 60–75px.
    
    Left column: approximately 45% width.
    
    Right column: approximately 55% width.
    
    Vertically centre both columns.
    
    Clean, premium, minimalist aesthetic.
    
    2. LEFT COLUMN – BABY IMAGE
    
    Display one large baby lifestyle photograph.
    
    Image should occupy approximately 400px × 420px on desktop.
    
    Use an elegant arch-shaped top border with softly rounded bottom corners.
    
    Image must use object-fit: cover.
    
    Baby should be wearing a white bamboo fabric outfit.
    
    Background should feel natural, warm, and organic.
    
    Add a thin, subtle circular outline behind the image for decorative depth.
    
    Add a circular yellow-orange floating percentage badge overlapping the bottom-right side of the image.
    
    Percentage badge:
    
    Background: #F2B52F.
    
    Perfect circular shape.
    
    Large bold text: "95%".
    
    Small uppercase text below: "BAMBOO VISCOSE".
    
    Text colour: dark olive.
    
    Keep badge approximately 90px × 90px.
    
    3. RIGHT COLUMN – CONTENT
    
    Use left-aligned content with carefully controlled spacing.
    
    Eyebrow text:
    "— WHY BAMBOO"
    
    Small uppercase lettering.
    
    Montserrat, 9px.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Warm cream colour.
    
    Main heading:
    "Why We Chose
    Bamboo."
    
    Montserrat ExtraBold.
    
    Font size: 38px desktop.
    
    Line height: 1.05.
    
    Cream/off-white colour (#F5F2E8).
    
    Maximum width: 400px.
    
    Description:
    "Bamboo viscose is silky to the touch, light on the skin and breathes with your baby — so they stay comfortable from the first nap to the last cuddle of the day."
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    13px desktop.
    
    Line height: 1.6.
    
    Muted cream colour.
    
    Maximum width: 490px.
    
    4. FOUR BENEFIT FEATURES
    
    Create a clean 2-column × 2-row grid beneath the description.
    
    Each feature must have:
    
    Small circular outlined icon container.
    
    Minimal thin-line icon in mustard yellow.
    
    Short heading in cream white.
    
    Supporting description in muted light cream.
    
    Feature 1:
    Icon: Feather
    Heading: "Ultra soft"
    Description: "A silky, buttery feel that's gentle against delicate newborn skin."
    
    Feature 2:
    Icon: Wind / Air
    Heading: "Naturally breathable"
    Description: "Airy fibres help keep little ones cool, calm and comfortable."
    
    Feature 3:
    Icon: Stretch / Expand
    Heading: "Stretch that moves"
    Description: "A touch of spandex lets every piece move with wiggles, kicks and cuddles."
    
    Feature 4:
    Icon: Heart
    Heading: "Kind to their skin"
    Description: "Smooth, soft fibres that feel gentle from the very first wear."
    
    Grid specifications:
    
    Two equal columns.
    
    Approximately 35px horizontal gap.
    
    Approximately 25px vertical gap.
    
    Icon size: 28–32px.
    
    Feature headings: Montserrat SemiBold, 13px.
    
    Descriptions: Montserrat Regular, 10px.
    
    Keep everything compact and aligned.
    
    5. BOTTOM CALL-TO-ACTION
    
    Place two horizontally aligned links below the feature grid.
    
    Primary button:
    Text: "Shop bamboo essentials →"
    
    Cream background (#F5F2E8).
    
    Dark olive text.
    
    Pill-shaped border radius.
    
    Montserrat SemiBold, 11px.
    
    Padding: 13px 24px.
    
    Subtle hover transition.
    
    Secondary text link:
    "Read the care guide"
    
    No background.
    
    Cream text.
    
    Small right-facing arrow optional.
    
    Underline on hover.
    
    6. TYPOGRAPHY & COLOURS
    
    Use Montserrat throughout the entire section.
    
    Colour palette:
    
    Background: #626B4C
    
    Primary text: #F5F2E8
    
    Secondary text: #D0D0B9
    
    Accent yellow: #F2B52F
    
    Icon colour: #DDAA32
    
    7. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    
    Maintain the exact two-column layout.
    
    Image on the left, content on the right.
    
    Tablet:
    
    Maintain two columns wherever space permits.
    
    Reduce image dimensions and typography proportionally.
    
    Mobile:
    
    Stack image first and content second.
    
    Centre the image.
    
    Keep the percentage badge overlapping the bottom-right corner.
    
    Heading should be approximately 30px.
    
    Feature grid should remain 2 columns if readable.
    
    Buttons should wrap naturally without overflowing.
    
    Use 24px horizontal section padding.
    
    Ensure no horizontal scrolling.
    
    8. SHOPIFY FUNCTIONALITY
    
    Generate a complete, self-contained Shopify Liquid section.
    
    Include editable Shopify schema settings for heading, description, eyebrow, image, percentage badge, benefit icons, benefit headings, benefit descriptions, button labels and button URLs.
    
    Allow image replacement directly through the Shopify theme editor.
    
    Use inline SVG icons or lightweight CSS icons.
    
    Make all typography and colours configurable where practical.
    
    Ensure compatibility with modern Shopify themes.
    
    Use semantic HTML, clean CSS and responsive breakpoints.
    
    Avoid external libraries and unnecessary JavaScript.
    
    Do not modify any other theme sections., allow me to change icons for all 4 factors as png also all the texts on this section as rich text, fix the badge text size and alignment perfectly , perfect now make this section completely mobile responsive all the texts , elements perfectly responsive\
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(40px,5.5vw,68px) 24px;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-family:Montserrat,var(--font-body--family,sans-serif);overflow:hidden;box-sizing:border-box}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }} *,.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }} *:before,.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }} *:after{box-sizing:border-box}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,45fr) minmax(0,55fr);align-items:center;gap:clamp(22px,3vw,40px)}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual{position:relative;min-width:0;width:100%;min-height:clamp(320px,37vw,440px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__ring{position:absolute;width:min(390px,90%);aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.ring_color }};border-radius:50%;opacity:.58}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo{position:relative;z-index:1;width:min(400px,90%);aspect-ratio:20/21;overflow:hidden;border-radius:50% 50% 18px 18px/34% 34% 18px 18px;background:#777b66}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo img,.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder{height:100%;position:relative}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg{width:100%;height:100%;background:#777b66}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder span{position:absolute;bottom:14px;left:10px;right:10px;text-align:center;color:#fff;font-size:12px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{position:absolute;z-index:2;right:2%;bottom:5px;width:96px;height:96px;padding:9px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:3px;background:{{ block.settings.badge_color }};color:{{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};text-align:center;overflow:hidden}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge p{margin:0!important;padding:0!important;text-align:center!important}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge p:first-child{font-size:clamp(21px,2vw,25px);line-height:1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.6px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge p:last-child{max-width:72px;font-size:7px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.65px;text-transform:uppercase}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content{min-width:0;width:100%;max-width:570px;margin-inline:auto}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{margin:0 0 17px;color:{{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};text-transform:uppercase;font-size:9px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:2px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow p,.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading p,.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description p,.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-heading p,.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-copy p{margin:0}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{margin:0 0 16px;max-width:400px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:clamp(30px,3.2vw,38px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.7px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description{max-width:490px;margin:0 0 22px;color:{{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};font-size:clamp(12px,1.1vw,13px);line-height:1.6}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));column-gap:clamp(12px,2.5vw,35px);row-gap:22px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:31px minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:10px;align-items:start;min-width:0}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{width:31px;height:31px;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.icon_color }};border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:{{ block.settings.icon_color }};overflow:hidden}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg{width:17px;height:17px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-heading{margin:1px 0 5px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-copy{color:{{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};font-size:10px;line-height:1.55;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 21px;margin-top:24px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:42px;max-width:100%;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:999px;background:{{ block.settings.button_color }};color:{{ block.settings.button_text_color }};text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;text-align:center;overflow-wrap:anywhere;transition:opacity .2s ease}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button:hover{opacity:.86}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button p,.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link p{margin:0}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link{max-width:100%;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid {{ block.settings.badge_color }};outline-offset:4px}
@media(max-width:900px) and (min-width:701px){.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:48px 22px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,42fr) minmax(0,58fr);gap:22px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual{min-height:350px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo{width:min(340px,92%)}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{font-size:32px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{column-gap:12px;row-gap:18px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature{grid-template-columns:28px minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:8px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{width:28px;height:28px}}
@media(max-width:700px){.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:100%;padding:38px 24px;overflow:clip}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:28px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual{min-height:0;width:100%;max-width:460px;margin:0 auto}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo{width:min(400px,86%);aspect-ratio:20/21}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__ring{width:min(360px,86%)}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{right:4%;bottom:5px;width:88px;height:88px;padding:8px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge p:first-child{font-size:23px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge p:last-child{font-size:6.5px;max-width:67px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content{max-width:540px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{margin-bottom:13px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{font-size:clamp(28px,8vw,34px);margin-bottom:13px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:20px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{column-gap:16px;row-gap:19px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature{grid-template-columns:30px minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:8px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{width:29px;height:29px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-heading{font-size:12px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-copy{font-size:10px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions{gap:12px 18px;margin-top:22px}}
@media(max-width:380px){.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:32px 18px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{column-gap:10px;row-gap:17px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature{grid-template-columns:26px minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:7px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{width:26px;height:26px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg{width:15px;height:15px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-heading{font-size:11px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-copy{font-size:9px;line-height:1.5}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button{padding:11px 17px}.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions{gap:12px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button{transition:none}}
{% endstyle %}
<section class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }} aria-labelledby="ai-bamboo-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><div class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><div class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual"><span class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__ring" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo">{% if block.settings.image != blank %}<img src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1000 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.image.alt | default: block.settings.image_alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.image.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.image.height }}">{% else %}<div class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span>Add a lifestyle image in the block settings</span></div>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge" aria-label="{{ block.settings.badge_percent | strip_html | escape }} {{ block.settings.badge_caption | strip_html | escape }}">{{ block.settings.badge_percent }}{{ block.settings.badge_caption }}</div></div><div class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content">{% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}<div class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow }}</div>{% endif %}<div id="ai-bamboo-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading" role="heading" aria-level="2">{{ block.settings.heading }}</div>{% if block.settings.description != blank %}<div class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ block.settings.description }}</div>{% endif %}<div class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid">{% for i in (1..4) %}{% liquid
assign title_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_heading'
assign desc_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_description'
assign icon_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_icon'
assign image_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_icon_image'
assign feature_title = block.settings[title_key]
assign feature_desc = block.settings[desc_key]
assign feature_icon = block.settings[icon_key]
assign feature_image = block.settings[image_key]
%}<article class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature"><span class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true">{% if feature_image != blank %}<img src="{{ feature_image | image_url: width: 100 }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="50" height="50">{% else %}{% case feature_icon %}{% when 'feather' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 4c-6 0-11 2-14 7-2 3-2 6-2 9 3 0 6 0 9-2 5-3 7-8 7-14Z"/><path d="M4 20c3-5 7-8 12-11M8 15l-1-4m5 0 1-3"/></svg>{% when 'air' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 8h12a3 3 0 1 0-3-3M3 12h16a2 2 0 1 1-2 2M3 16h9a3 3 0 1 1-3 3"/></svg>{% when 'stretch' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 4 4 8l4 4M4 8h12a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-2m2 4 4-4-4-4"/></svg>{% else %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.8 8.6c0 5.2-8.8 11-8.8 11S3.2 13.8 3.2 8.6A4.6 4.6 0 0 1 12 6.4a4.6 4.6 0 0 1 8.8 2.2Z"/></svg>{% endcase %}{% endif %}</span><div><div class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-heading" role="heading" aria-level="3">{{ feature_title }}</div><div class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__feature-copy">{{ feature_desc }}</div></div></article>{% endfor %}</div><div class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__actions">{% if block.settings.primary_label != blank and block.settings.primary_url != blank %}<a class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__button" href="{{ block.settings.primary_url }}">{{ block.settings.primary_label }}</a>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.secondary_label != blank and block.settings.secondary_url != blank %}<a class="ai-bamboo-{{ ai_gen_id }}__link" href="{{ block.settings.secondary_url }}">{{ block.settings.secondary_label }}</a>{% endif %}</div></div></div></section>
